{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A CLASSIC RTS WITH MODERN LOOK</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crimson Freedom is a gripping real-time strategy game featuring three thrilling campaigns. Set on 22nd-century Mars, the game follows the epic struggle of ideologies battling for supremacy over the red planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RTS DONE RIGHT</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is classic RTS at its finest\u2014everything you love, perfected for the modern era. With base building, army management, resource systems, compelling campaigns, and strong, distinctive factions, our game delivers the pure RTS experience, enhanced with modern looks and thoughtful innovations. No gimmicks, just the timeless strategy you expect, done right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SINGLE PLAYER FIRST</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a single-player experience crafted with care, featuring three immersive campaigns with over 40 hours of gameplay. Set in a richly detailed sci-fi world, you\u2019ll explore the future of humanity from three unique perspectives, gradually uncovering the full truth as you progress at your own pace.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3973160?t=1756140821","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973160/1495c8a4ba99d0710a4532cc8c50552cda3aa671/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756140821","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973160/a153dde60ec27e826e454dea9e91030c7d6bf0dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756140821","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973160/a153dde60ec27e826e454dea9e91030c7d6bf0dd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756140821","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed